    "summary": "While choosing this model to [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), you may pay 1 **Pain token** to make it [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). Once it Advances, embarked units may disembark. Their movement counts as a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) for the phase. They may otherwise act as usual, with charge declarations barred that turn.",
